---
import Photo from "./Photo.astro";
---

<section
  class="community-story"
  id="our-story"
  aria-labelledby="community-story-heading"
>
  <div class="wrap story-inner">
    <header class="story-heading">
      <span class="story-label">Our story</span>
      <h2 id="community-story-heading">How we started.</h2>
      <div class="story-people" role="group" aria-label="Meetup co-organisers">
        <figure class="story-person story-person-mehedi">
          <Photo
            name="dsc08548"
            alt="Mehedi Sharif seated with his phone at the GHL Bangladesh meetup"
            sizes="(max-width: 760px) 45vw, 225px"
          />
          <figcaption>Mehedi Sharif</figcaption>
        </figure>
        <figure class="story-person story-person-shariful">
          <Photo
            name="dsc08543"
            alt="Shariful Islam speaking into a microphone at the GHL Bangladesh meetup"
            width={1800}
            height={1201}
            sizes="(max-width: 760px) 45vw, 225px"
          />
          <figcaption>
            <a
              href="https://www.facebook.com/vidmshariful"
              target="_blank"
              rel="noopener noreferrer"
              aria-label="Shariful Islam on Facebook (opens in a new tab)"
              >Shariful Islam</a
            >
          </figcaption>
        </figure>
      </div>
    </header>
    <div class="story-copy">
      <p>
        GHL Bangladesh began with conversations between
        <a
          href="https://www.facebook.com/vidmshariful"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
          aria-label="Shariful Islam on Facebook (opens in a new tab)"
          ><strong>Shariful Islam</strong></a
        > and me. We kept talking about how many people in Bangladesh work with GoHighLevel
        every day, yet hardly ever meet in person. We wanted a chance to sit together,
        compare experiences, and get to know the people doing the same work.
      </p>
      <p>
        So we decided to organise an unofficial, community-driven meetup. The
        idea was simple: GHL users in one room, asking questions and sharing
        what was actually working for them.
      </p>
      <p>
        Shariful and I organised that gathering together. For me, starting GHL
        Bangladesh was a way to make those conversations happen: people here
        meeting face to face, sharing practical knowledge, and learning from one
        another.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .community-story {
    background: #f6f8f1;
    color: #193f33;
    font-family: "DM Sans", Arial, sans-serif;
  }
  .story-inner {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 0.8fr) minmax(0, 1.2fr);
    align-items: start;
    gap: clamp(44px, 7vw, 100px);
    padding-block: 76px 88px;
    border-top: 1px solid #d6ddcf;
  }
  .story-label {
    display: block;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
    color: #64745f;
    font:
      600 10px/1.5 "DM Sans",
      sans-serif;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    text-transform: none;
  }
  .story-heading h2 {
    max-width: 360px;
    margin: 0;
    color: #193f33;
    font-family: "DM Sans", Arial, sans-serif;
    font-size: clamp(32px, 3.2vw, 42px);
    font-weight: 700;
    line-height: 1.2;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
  }
  .story-copy a,
  .story-person figcaption a {
    white-space: nowrap;
    text-decoration: underline;
    text-underline-offset: 3px;
    text-decoration-thickness: 1px;
  }
  .story-copy a:hover,
  .story-person figcaption a:hover {
    color: #52714b;
  }
  .story-copy a:focus-visible,
  .story-person figcaption a:focus-visible {
    outline: 2px solid #315344;
    outline-offset: 4px;
  }
  .story-people {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
    gap: 14px;
    margin-top: 30px;
  }
  .story-person {
    min-width: 0;
    margin: 0;
  }
  .story-person :global(img) {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    aspect-ratio: 4 / 5;
    height: auto;
    object-fit: cover;
    object-position: center;
    border-radius: 3px;
  }
  .story-person-shariful :global(img) {
    object-position: 62% center;
  }
  .story-person-mehedi :global(img) {
    object-position: 72% center;
  }
  .story-person figcaption {
    margin-top: 8px;
    color: #315344;
    font-size: 14px;
    font-weight: 500;
    line-height: 1.5;
  }
  .story-copy {
    max-width: 660px;
  }
  .story-copy p {
    margin: 0;
    color: #536b5b;
    font-size: 17px;
    line-height: 1.85;
  }
  .story-copy p + p {
    margin-top: 23px;
  }
  @media (max-width: 760px) {
    .story-inner {
      grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr);
      gap: 30px;
      padding-block: 48px 56px;
    }
    .story-label {
      margin-bottom: 16px;
    }
    .story-heading h2 {
      max-width: 340px;
      font-size: clamp(30px, 7.5vw, 36px);
    }
    .story-people {
      gap: 12px;
      margin-top: 26px;
    }
    .story-person figcaption {
      font-size: 13px;
    }
    .story-copy {
      max-width: 100%;
    }
    .story-copy p {
      line-height: 1.8;
    }
    .story-copy p + p {
      margin-top: 21px;
    }
  }
</style>
